--- the characterisation, read off the disagreeing set rather than assumed ---
  F=8: distinct values of (p mod 2^F) among disagreeing pairs: [127, 129]
  F=8: 2^(F-1) - 1 = 127
  F=8: distinct values of p's lowest bit: [1]
