  'p mod 2^F == 2^(F-1)' predicts 1024 pairs; identical to actual: False   (must be False)

--- C-N: predict at a width 169 did not report ---
  F=5  count    16  2^(F-1)    16  count match True  set match False
  F=7  count    64  2^(F-1)    64  count match True  set match False
